   7. Extract infection/immunity transition logic from `Animal.act()` into a `HealthBehaviour` component
   8. Replace `List<Location>` in `Field.adjacentLocations` with an `Iterator`-based approach to reduce object allocation
   9. (Pending, text-only summary requested) Extract Simulator's view-update and step management into a `SimulationEngine` controller

